<title>BELGIUM: CREDIT GENERAL H1 1996 PROFIT UP 12 PCT.</title>
<headline>CREDIT GENERAL H1 1996 PROFIT UP 12 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			  388  vs     346</p>
<p>    Net interest plus other income   2,737  vs   2,074</p>
<p>    Operating costs			1,292  vs   1,261</p>
<p>    Write downs, provisions, etc.	767  vs     282</p>
<p>    Taxes					293  vs     190</p>
<p>    Total assets			 261,261  vs 244,069</p>
<p>NOTE - Credit General is controlled by Belgium's Kredietbank</p>
<p>NV .</p>
